---
config:
  theme: neutral
description: one representative state diagram in the neutral theme
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> check : request
  state check <<choice>>
  check --> Working : valid
  check --> Idle : invalid
  state Working {
    [*] --> Reading
    Reading --> Writing
    --
    [*] --> Logging
  }
  Working --> Done
  note right of Done : All done
  classDef hot fill:#f96,stroke:#333
  class Done hot
  Done --> [*]
